      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry, very late comment: we should explain the downsides of enabling tombstones for non-debuggable - there\u0027s a chance the tombstone could leak something sensitive from inside the protected VM, thereby breaching the protection.\n\n(Because really most VMs shouldn\u0027t do this; CompOS does because its secrets are never held anywhere that might be covered and most of what it does can be public.)",
